{"id":"problema","lemma":"problema","pos":"noun","rank":180,"glosses":["problem, issue, challenge (a difficulty or obstacle that has to be dealt with)","trouble (in the singular or in the plural)","question, dilemma, conundrum"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈblema/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"problemas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-problema.wav","formAudio":{"problemas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-problemas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Y cuál es tu problema?","en":"And what's your problem?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458692","words":[{"g":"and"},{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"¿Estoy en problemas?","en":"Am I in trouble?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441385","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué problema tienes con tu coche?","en":"What is the matter with your car?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608448","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"car, automobile"}]},{"text":"Sé que tienes problemas con tu madre.","en":"I know that you have issues with your mom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609862","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"with"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"a catch-all retort"]]},{"text":"¡No hay problema!","en":"No problem!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505529","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]}]}